    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρχ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beginning</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράγματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					1209.11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, cf. Callicr. ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.28.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.12.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. διαφορᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					22.4.14
				</span></i>
			,al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Mim. Oxy.</u>
					413.213
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>forecast of an undertaking, voyage</i>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Serapio
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				1.99
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				187.15
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ καταρχῶν</span>,
			title of poems by Maximus and <i><span class="en">
				Heph.Astr.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>part of victim first offered,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1359
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>primacy, sovereignty</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἁθρόου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					314
				</span></i>
			; <i>starting-point, basis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.246
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς Χάριτας</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶναι</span>] <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς
				ἡμετέρας κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				14
			</span></i>.</div>
